#NEXUS

[ Bonaparte, González Riga & Apesteguía 2006, Cretaceous Research 27: 364-376, Fig. 8: strict consensus of two MPTs for Ligabuesaurus, a slanted cladogram with angled tip labels along the top, numbered nodes and bracketed support values (e.g. 51/46) beside clade names; 20 tips. The figure prints 'Diplodocus carnegii' and 'Jobaria tinguidensis' where the matrix has 'Diplodus longus' and 'Jobaria tiguidensis'. 20 tips, slanted (diagonal) cladogram with the spine rising to the right. Node 5 is a 3-way polytomy (Ligabuesaurus, Phuwiangosaurus, rest): both branches meet the spine at the same point. Diplodocus joins the Jobaria branch (node 15); Mendozasaurus and Aeolosaurus pair (node 17) before joining Isisaurus (node 16). Matrix spellings are used where the figure differs: Diplodus_longus (printed Diplodocus carnegii), Jobaria_tiguidensis (printed tinguidensis), Opisthocoelicaudia_skarzynski (printed skarzynskii). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the image (2026-10-28); topology only, no support values or node numbers. Licence: not open-licensed; image kept in bench/images, uncommitted. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=20;
    TAXLABELS
        Patagosaurus_fariasi
        Jobaria_tiguidensis
        Diplodus_longus
        Camarasaurus_grandis
        Brachiosaurus_brancai
        Chubutisaurus_insignis
        Ligabuesaurus_leanzai
        Phuwiangosaurus_sirindhornae
        Andesaurus_delgadoi
        Malawisaurus_dixeyi
        Lirainosaurus_astibiae
        Isisaurus_colberti
        Mendozasaurus_neguyelap
        Aeolosaurus_rionegrinus
        Rapetosaurus_krausei
        Opisthocoelicaudia_skarzynski
        Alamosaurus_sanjuanensis
        Neuquensaurus_australis
        Saltasaurus_loricatus
        Rocasaurus_muniozi
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE bonaparte2006a_fig8 = [&R] (Patagosaurus_fariasi,((Jobaria_tiguidensis,Diplodus_longus),(Camarasaurus_grandis,(Brachiosaurus_brancai,(Chubutisaurus_insignis,(Ligabuesaurus_leanzai,Phuwiangosaurus_sirindhornae,(Andesaurus_delgadoi,(Malawisaurus_dixeyi,(Lirainosaurus_astibiae,((Isisaurus_colberti,(Mendozasaurus_neguyelap,Aeolosaurus_rionegrinus)),(Rapetosaurus_krausei,(Opisthocoelicaudia_skarzynski,(Alamosaurus_sanjuanensis,(Neuquensaurus_australis,(Saltasaurus_loricatus,Rocasaurus_muniozi)))))))))))))));
END;
